A '''scavenger''', also known as a '''salvager''', was an individual that salvaged old and discarded items and parts for sale or later use.

==History==
[[File:Scavenge_SWDA.png|thumb|left|250px|Rey, scavenging parts from a [[Star Destroyer]] on Jakku]][[Gha Nachkt]] was a [[Trandoshan]] scavenger operating during the [[Clone Wars]] who captured R2-D2 and intended to sell him to [[General]] [[Grievous]].<ref name="Duel of the Droids">{{TCW|Duel of the Droids}}</ref>

[[Jawa]]s were scavengers by nature.<ref name="readalong" /> A group of Jawa scavengers on [[Tatooine]] discovered the [[droid]]s [[C-3PO]] and [[R2-D2]] in the [[planet]]'s [[desert]] [[Jundland Wastes|wastes]] and sold them to [[Owen Lars]].<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

[[Sarco Plank]] was a scavenger in the [[Niima Outpost]] on [[Jakku]].<ref name="DB">{{Databank|sarco-plank|Sarco Plank}}</ref> He was known as "The Scavenger" while living on [[Devaron]].<ref name="The Weapon of a Jedi">''[[The Weapon of a Jedi: A Luke Skywalker Adventure]]''</ref>

[[Rey Skywalker|Rey]] was a [[human]] scavenger on the planet [[Jakku]] who scavenged parts from various [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] and [[New Republic]] vehicles and [[Starship|ships]] leftover after the [[Battle of Jakku]]. She exchanged parts with [[Unkar Plutt]] for portions of [[ration pack]]s.<ref name="Episode VII">{{Film|VII}}</ref>

